From 1e865e66ba7964746cb9f50b624109102a47014d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Vlad Popa <pvlad@google.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Aug 2024 19:11:42 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 088/436] APM: forward mute state in APM to AF

With ring_my_car we pass the mute state together with the actual index
to AudioFlinger

Flag: com.android.media.audio.ring_my_car
Test: dumpsys + logs
Bug: 319515324
Change-Id: I7b219f9c4917b58a84fd51c0431098a77896887a
